    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Apply a continuous layer of 80-GSM bubble wraps around all exposed metallic surfaces, specifically targeting the handlebars, pedal cranks, and rear axle assembly. This initial layer serves as the primary defense against micro-scratches and minor impacts during the bike transport via train.</p>
